# Security

Read `docs/SECURITY.md`.

## MUST

- Use env / CI secrets for Cognito IDs — never hardcode
- Fail closed on `/admin` when auth is missing or invalid
- Avoid logging tokens or full cookie headers

## MUST NOT

- Commit `.env` or private keys
- Weaken JWT issuer / token_use / scope checks without human review
